    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9966b6ecc870c2e1f10e6470",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个世界——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61dccbba3272eaeacde4ce4b98ebf4f84b5c6e332126c617dabb41bca327e626",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26bfb9d2a8750f14e51f4fe9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论多少次，无论多少次。\n只要挑战到能够跨越过去为止就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e8959201817ec1b37e94f5ace877251eab79b66caaa231e9a92f45e32aade5d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c996274caf59c52f24b7a532",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为在圣女红色梦想面前，\n根本不存在无法跨越的试炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ee454cc2234dd89e992f6f19b87dd330d933691aaee47536eb2a9512f3fbfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68ed289eb393dbb337d9ab98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历了激烈的『育马者杯』之后，\n过去了一段时间——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3499ef57fd919c3319140a135145cbdf0ec10f74a17d4a8ae38007f451b2aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb466f3170f088e3f85d6f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『育马者杯』。这是只有红色梦想\n长期以来所渴求的、被选中的强者才会齐聚的，\n世界顶尖级别的试炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5cd309d925a25b70146044181696465a93a5d6bb37186563cd51326262988a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec86e59b55e7db5d41ef6c4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此前一直侵蚀着红色梦想身体的\n『红之楔』，医生下达了已经接近\n彻底痊愈的诊断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc8b61428a5053c2060e6a32670921e95df42a9bab315994303ac7d1e3c02c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e248cfabab5cbc2d617c165a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跨越了在『育马者杯』中令人惋惜的失败……她，\n更是让那强韧的精神力，\n得到了进一步的淬炼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b3590e96231938e9d87777220edcfffdf8f013cb9e23dd424b922aec4ceff77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dcfc84241689551796c2a5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此，这才是自己所相信的\n圣女红色梦想的姿态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a923e5379e375b07fccda65fefff8d241748a47117f4a342b8b21ce7c3d1094d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1647527db5f4a45dccdffe22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
