    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484570543206000a89b8164e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『——第4弯道，距离终点不足400米！\n已经进入了直道！ 从外侧冲上来的是\n红色梦想！ 红色梦想！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d8c75bedeae6cbc32d856e8d365b9cc65df7ea63e58d5835f86d197dc74a20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade798b5c3e68652c3a3d986",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每当跨越试炼之时，\n便会变得更强、更高贵，\n那份灵魂，也被美丽地打磨着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89167b503e42c177660bb0b215176798a5889e7aed0a78c535d3c9f3f1e16079",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136110.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab51d73e7f87359820e1b344",
      "kind": "story",
